OL,3,GNEWSACoventry Cathedral's 12,000
OL,4,Amedieval glass fragments go digital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA collection of around 12,000 items of
OL,7,Frare medieval glass, thought to have
OL,8,Fbeen made by one of the most important
OL,9,Fglaziers of the period, has been made
OL,10,Fviewable via a new app.
OL,12,FThe collection is held by Coventry
OL,13,Fcathedral and represents an
OL,14,Finternationally significant collection
OL,15,Fof 15th century religious stained
OL,16,Fglass.
OL,18,FThe fragments came from the city's
OL,19,Fcathedral, the only one destroyed in
OL,20,Fthe UK during World War Two.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
