OL,3,GNEWSACoventry Cathedral's 12,000
OL,4,Amedieval glass fragments go digital
OL,5,
OL,6,FReverend Canon Nitano Muller, from the
OL,7,Fcathedral, said: "It gives us a glimpse
OL,8,Finto the lives of the people in the
OL,9,F15th century, about 12,000 pieces of
OL,10,Fglass that we have, perhaps the largest
OL,11,Fin Britain at the moment. [It is] akin
OL,12,Fto the glass that you'd find in
OL,13,FWestminster Abbey or Canterbury
OL,14,FCathedral."
